<title>UK: Abtrust names institutional sales, mktg director.</title>
<headline>Abtrust names institutional sales, mktg director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fund manager Aberdeen Trust said on Thursday it had recruited Bill Johnstone as institutional sales and marketing director.</p>
<p>A statement said Johnstone, previously a director at Edinburgh Fund Managers, would spearhead the group's drive into the institutional and pension fund market and strengthen contacts with UK institutional investors.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +171 542 5887</p>
